{
  "bookId": "hero-212203",
  "id": "bond-28534",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28534001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "你好久没来看我了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28534003",
              "text": "抱歉，的确有段时间……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28534002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28534003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "是因为后宅那堆女人吗，真是个招蜂引蝶的家伙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28534004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "她们想把你抢走，我要找机会把她们都处理掉，\n嗯……「S-VIII」除外。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28534006",
              "text": "「S-VIII」除外，为什么呢？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28534005",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28534006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "她是个很有意思的家伙，跟后宅的其他女人不一样，\n而且，我打不过她。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28534008",
              "text": "后面才是重点吧？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28534007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28534008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "如果是为了|101|，我会打到底的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28534010",
              "text": "听起来很危险。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28534009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28534010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "只要是你，我什么都愿意做。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28534012",
              "text": "嗯……我是说……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28534011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28534012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "我知道，你在关心我，\n你可以直说的，想叫「老婆」也没关系。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28534014",
              "text": "话也不是那么说……"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28534014",
              "text": "……好吧。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28534013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28534014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "水城结奈",
          "text": "那就当你答应了，试试吧，那两个字。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
